WEBVTT

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:20.550
These plans for after graduation...

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:23.500
Rio's the only one who didn't write anything.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:26.340
Where is it that you want to go, Rio?

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:29.500
My parents' homeland, the Yagumo region.

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:52.190
Seirei Gensouki

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:52.190
Seirei Gensouki

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:07.990
<b>Kingdom of Lies</b>

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:07.990
<b>Kingdom of Lies</b>

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:07.990
As you already know,

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:10.940
magic uses formulae designed 
to control magical power.

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:15.260
By pouring od through them, this craft 
meddles with matters of the world.

00:02:15.970 --> 00:02:19.460
Today, the fifth and 
sixth-years will use Lighting

00:02:19.460 --> 00:02:22.290
to deepen their understanding 
of controlling magical power.

00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:23.700
Lighting?

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:28.920
Professor! Anyone in this room should 
be able to use low-level magic like—

00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:30.210
No, wait.

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:33.130
There is one person who can't use it.

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:34.690
Yes, there is!

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:37.700
A lecture intended for those 
with poor magic control...

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:39.680
Isn't it a little late for all of that?

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:47.110
I see.

00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:50.310
Well then, will you two 
try using Lighting for me?

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:51.550
Yes, Miss!

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:54.520
Lighting!

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:02.570
At that level, I can't say 
you've mastered it yet.

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:05.470
What do you mean?

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:09.580
Being able to cast a covenant formula 
depends on a person's affinity.

00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:13.080
It's not the same as being 
skillful in magical control.

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:20.790
Even without the use of magic, 
with the existence of artifacts,

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:23.710
there are those who can use multiple 
magical techniques simultaneously.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:25.390
Like this.

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:27.900
Dectet Magician.

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:30.230
Lighting.

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:39.200
That's amazing!

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:41.960
One person can control that 
many Lightings at once?!

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:56.920
<i>It's true that I can't cast magical 
covenant formulae like they can.</i>

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.260
<i>But...</i>

00:03:58.260 --> 00:04:00.410
<i>by imitating the flow of magical power,</i>

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:03.050
<i>for some reason I'm able to 
reproduce magical techniques.</i>

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:07.680
All right!

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:11.520
Now, let's begin our lecture 
on magical control!

00:04:18.990 --> 00:04:20.940
Just what I'd expect from you,
 Professor Celia!

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:23.160
I found that so moving!

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:26.040
Why, thank you.

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:27.490
Hey, commoner.

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:31.700
It seems you've been seducing 
the female students of late.

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:34.120
What do you mean?

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:35.830
Don't flatter yourself.

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:38.740
Your win in the tournament 
was simply a fluke.

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:42.210
I understand completely.

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:44.400
Then stop trying to push yourself forward.

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:46.970
Stewart, stop that, now.

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:49.100
You're of the nobility, aren't you?

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:52.470
You shouldn't lay criticism 
without definite evidence.

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:56.480
B-But... this brat even 
tries flirting with you!

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.980
Nothing of that sort has ever happened.

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:03.600
Hey, commoner.

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:06.420
If you try anything foolish 
during the outdoor practicum,

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:09.160
the house of Duke Huguenot
 will not stay silent!

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:15.130
Sir Rio...

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:16.910
Flora?

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:19.430
It's just...

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:23.300
That was clearly a false accusation, wasn't it?

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:24.300
Yes.

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:28.540
But not getting involved 
is best for all of us.

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:31.060
I'm sure he understands that, too.

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:32.480
Oh, but...

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:36.010
<i>He is always taking care of 
things on his own like that.</i>

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:39.560
<i>And I still haven't been able 
to do anything to repay him.</i>

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:49.660
This is where our outdoor practicum 
is being held, isn't it?

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:50.420
Yes.

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:54.700
They're going to test how well we've 
learned military exercises at the academy.

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:56.940
I'm a little nervous.

00:05:56.940 --> 00:05:58.940
There is no need to worry.

00:05:58.940 --> 00:06:02.800
It's a team competition, and all the most 
dangerous monsters have been culled.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:05.920
Now, I will tell you the details 
of the practicum from the notice.

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:09.700
In order to withdraw from 
a battle zone, our units

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:13.430
will travel the shortest course through 
this mountain forest and aim for the goal.

00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:16.500
The operation lasts until sunset.

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:20.690
Good results here will have a tremendous 
impact on all of our grades.

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:24.370
My friends, let's reach the 
goal by this afternoon!

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:25.690
Yeah!

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:27.690
Won't that be impossible?

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:30.080
This is a wooded, mountainous area.

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:32.870
It will take twice as 
long to travel anywhere.

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:34.930
Not to worry.

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:37.870
I've already got a special course in mind.

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:39.710
What do you mean?

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.140
The soldiers who serve in my home region

00:06:42.140 --> 00:06:45.140
just happened to be quite knowledgeable 
about the geography of this area.

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:49.300
I had them tell me about all the animal 
paths that can be used as shortcuts.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:51.590
Then I passed it on to our upperclassmen.

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:56.060
It feels like cheating. I don't like it.

00:06:56.510 --> 00:07:01.490
To say that information controls 
everything in war is no exaggeration.

00:07:01.490 --> 00:07:05.520
We're practically guaranteed 
a good result here.

00:07:06.140 --> 00:07:08.740
What do you think, Princess Christina?

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:12.290
I'll leave it to you.

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:15.240
After all, you are the 
commander of this unit.

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.440
Thank you.

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:19.240
Then, let's move out!

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:20.250
Yeah!

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:21.900
Hey, commoner.

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:23.420
Consider yourself honored.

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:26.530
You're a hindrance who can't even use magic,

00:07:26.530 --> 00:07:28.760
but we've prepared a job
 that even you can do.

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:30.730
This is everyone's luggage.

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:32.760
Carry it and follow us.

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:34.870
Understood.

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:38.430
Don't you dare do anything uncalled for.

00:07:41.050 --> 00:07:42.140
Excuse me.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:43.810
Um...

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:46.940
Shall I carry a little of that?

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:47.820
What?

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:50.560
No, I'm fine.

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:53.160
Thank you for your concern.

00:08:03.510 --> 00:08:05.560
This just isn't right.

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:07.580
Why is it only Sir Rio 
who must endure such...

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:08.500
Monsters!

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:19.150
Don't panic, everyone! They're goblins!

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:22.820
The three in the vanguard should use 
artifacts to boost their physical abilities.

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:23.900
Charge!

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:26.810
Enchant Physical Ability!

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:43.550
They were nothing much. 
We need more formidable monsters.

00:08:43.550 --> 00:08:46.730
Just as I'd expect from you, Stewart.
You're so reliable.

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:48.290
By way of contrast...

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:50.250
Hey, Rio!

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:51.840
Don't just stand there in a daze!

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.840
My apologies.

00:08:58.670 --> 00:09:02.810
That was much too close. To think anyone 
would notice at this distance...

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:05.230
What an impossible child.

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:14.190
Shall we test him a little and
 see what his true capabilities are?

00:09:15.390 --> 00:09:16.700
We're out of the forest!

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:18.660
The goal is close!

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:22.570
All right! Hooray!

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:26.130
A cliff?

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:27.760
It can't be!

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:28.950
What's going on?

00:09:29.510 --> 00:09:31.860
Maybe his information was wrong?

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:34.300
What are we going to do? 
Go back the way we came?

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.330
We'd lose a lot of time.

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:39.640
Commander.

00:09:40.190 --> 00:09:41.510
Y-Yes?

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:44.300
Where do we head next?

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:46.710
The path seems to come to an end here.

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:49.560
Well... That's...

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:56.450
Th-There are orcs!

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:58.660
Everyone! Defenses!

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:01.760
V-Vanguard!

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:03.660
Raise shields and block the spears!

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:10.750
Ow! It hurts! It hurts!

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:11.700
Help me...

00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:12.880
Stop it!

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:21.420
Flora!

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:47.400
Sir Rio?

00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:49.720
Flora!

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:54.590
We need to focus on exterminating 
the monsters first!

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:56.590
D-Defend!

00:10:56.910 --> 00:10:59.190
Vanguard, raise shields and form a wall.

00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:02.170
Rear guard, use attack magic 
to lay down a barrage!

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:04.320
Roanna, tend to the injured!

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:10.140
Blitz Shot!

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:18.740
Blitz Shot!

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:29.210
Blitz Shot!

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:42.230
<i>I wonder if falling from there without 
a single injury will make them</i>

00:11:42.230 --> 00:11:43.760
<i>suspicious of me.</i>

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:47.140
<i>I saved her without thinking about it.</i>

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:57.260
<i>It isn't magic or magical techniques.</i>

00:11:57.770 --> 00:12:01.990
<i>Even now, I don't know what 
this power actually is...</i>

00:12:04.900 --> 00:12:06.330
<i>Or anything about that girl.</i>

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:07.530
You can't be serious!

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:10.330
You say I pushed 
Princess Flora off the cliff?!

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:12.790
No, I wouldn't go so far as that.

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:17.770
It's just that Alphonse asked me if anyone 
might have bumped into Princess Flora.

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:20.030
I was pushed, too!

00:12:20.030 --> 00:12:21.630
I am a victim here!

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:23.580
Someone else is responsible!

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:25.930
Getting overexcited isn't 
good for your wounds.

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:27.970
And after I treated them for you, too.

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:30.300
Stewart, please, calm down.

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:33.560
I'm simply trying to understand 
the circumstances.

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:36.780
Th-That's right! I've just remembered.

00:12:37.260 --> 00:12:40.450
It's that commoner who's responsible!

00:12:40.450 --> 00:12:41.300
Did you just...

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:42.530
Yes.

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:46.690
In that moment, the coward was so 
frightened of the monsters' attack that,

00:12:46.690 --> 00:12:49.640
though I am injured, he pushed 
me with all his might!

00:12:49.640 --> 00:12:53.900
Because of that, I could not avoid 
colliding with Princess Flora!

00:12:53.900 --> 00:12:57.650
So, fearful of committing the crime of 
killing a member of the royal family,

00:12:57.650 --> 00:13:00.030
that man may have saved
 Princess Flora in his desperation,

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:03.050
but in return, he fell from the cliff himself?

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:05.680
Th-That can't be what happened!

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:09.390
Sir Rio was simply trying 
his hardest to save me!

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:12.080
<i>This has gotten problematic.</i>

00:13:12.510 --> 00:13:13.890
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:17.220
He's the one responsible. 
Right, my upperclassmen?

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:18.900
Y-Yes.

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:21.980
Is this really the time to 
be looking for a culprit?

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:22.860
Commander!

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:26.370
Th-Then, as Her Highness
 the Princess is safe,

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:28.660
let's find a way out of the forest!

00:13:30.020 --> 00:13:33.080
<i>I had planned to graduate 
from the academy, but...</i>

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:35.910
Please, wait!

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:38.670
Are you saying we're 
going to abandon Sir Rio?

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:42.000
That fall was just him 
getting what he deserves.

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:43.850
Getting what he deserves?

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:47.680
Then my nearly falling was 
me getting what I deserved.

00:13:48.030 --> 00:13:51.180
I am going to go help Sir Rio, 
even if I have to go alone!

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:53.590
You mustn't!

00:13:53.590 --> 00:13:56.040
What are you saying, Princess Flora?

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:57.880
Flora, calm down.

00:13:57.880 --> 00:14:01.190
As soon as this practicum is over, 
we'll send out a search party!

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:23.500
Why is a monster like that...

00:14:23.890 --> 00:14:26.780
Why are you just standing there?
 We'll be killed!

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:29.510
Thunder Ball!

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:37.430
Wha—

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:42.730
If Thunder Ball doesn't work, 
we need to use Ice Lance!

00:14:43.430 --> 00:14:45.800
Vanguard, increase your physical abilities!

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:47.740
Ice Lance!

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:51.740
Enchant Physical Ability!

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:05.050
Re...

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:06.440
Retreat!

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:08.280
Run!

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:12.550
Princess Christina! 
Please get a hold of yourself!

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:13.540
Of course...

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:14.740
Where is Flora?

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:17.780
I believe she has already escaped.

00:15:17.780 --> 00:15:19.290
We should hurry as well.

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:25.730
Are you all right?

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:44.260
No!

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:50.550
Please, take him and get away from here!

00:15:50.870 --> 00:15:51.700
Sir Rio!

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:52.760
Hurry!

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:54.010
Right!

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:55.110
This way!

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:57.010
Come on!

00:16:06.890 --> 00:16:07.690
<i>He's tough.</i>

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:08.860
<i>And...</i>

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:09.610
<i>He's fast!</i>

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:12.950
<i>I can't die here.</i>

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:15.910
<i>So why did I come back to save her?</i>

00:16:20.360 --> 00:16:21.290
He's amazing!

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:49.440
<i>Now.</i>

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:09.080
Why was that monster—

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:10.300
Princess Flora!

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:12.800
Princess Flora, are you hurt?

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:15.580
No. I'm s-so sorry!

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:25.880
<i>My. I got to witness something even 
more entertaining than I'd expected.</i>

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:27.390
<i>That black hair...</i>

00:17:27.390 --> 00:17:31.150
<i>Is he the offspring of people who drifted 
here from the Yagumo region, I wonder?</i>

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:35.020
<i>If so, I can see why he'd be 
able to use the spirit arts.</i>

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:37.770
<i>What a worrisome child.</i>

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:43.080
Honestly!

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:46.870
The Head of the Academy
 is such a taskmaster!

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:49.990
You could just do the 
research yourself, you know!

00:17:49.990 --> 00:17:53.000
And these materials on monsters are so old...

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:57.130
And so, that commoner...

00:17:57.540 --> 00:18:00.180
Rio has gone missing.

00:18:02.590 --> 00:18:07.390
But Princess Flora is 
advocating for this... Rio.

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:09.170
Lord Garcia,

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:12.930
if the standing of the 
House of Huguenot is put at risk,

00:18:12.930 --> 00:18:15.900
it will only embolden 
the house of Duke Arbor.

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:18.840
That would be bad for the kingdom,
 would it not?

00:18:20.940 --> 00:18:24.430
<i>The royal family has become weak.</i>

00:18:24.860 --> 00:18:27.000
It's maddening!

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:31.660
Now that things have come to this, I suppose
 we have no choice but to blame the boy.

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:34.930
I'll leave the rest to you,

00:18:34.930 --> 00:18:36.770
Duke Huguenot.

00:18:36.770 --> 00:18:38.220
Understood.

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:40.680
Please leave the matter to me hereafter.

00:18:44.990 --> 00:18:45.780
<i>Rio...</i>

00:18:46.190 --> 00:18:48.010
<i>What could have happened?</i>

00:18:57.230 --> 00:18:58.030
Who's there?

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:00.800
It's Rio.

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:02.530
I'm sorry for causing such a commotion.

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:08.710
P-Professor...

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:11.210
I was really worried!

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:12.960
I'm sorry.

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:15.540
Are you hurt? Are you all right?

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:17.450
That tickles!

00:19:21.280 --> 00:19:25.220
That's horrible. What are they thinking? 
They're laying a false charge!

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:27.900
Rio, you haven't done anything wrong!

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:32.700
It's the people in power who 
decide what's wrong or not.

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:36.730
Even if I appealed with the truth, 
no one would acknowledge it.

00:19:37.270 --> 00:19:39.320
It's because I'm not of the nobility.

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:43.470
I'm sorry.

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:47.740
The truth is, I wish I could do 
something about this for you, but...

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.140
Please, don't apologize.

00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:51.880
Everything is thanks to you, Professor.

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:54.250
It's thanks to you

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:57.750
that I've been able to come this far 
without crumbling and going bad.

00:19:58.810 --> 00:20:00.650
I'm glad I was able to meet you, Professor.

00:20:01.310 --> 00:20:03.260
I truly mean that.

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:05.830
Rio...

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:09.270
That's why you were the one person 
I wanted to say goodbye to, Professor.

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:11.800
You're going to the Yagumo region, aren't you?

00:20:12.810 --> 00:20:13.770
Yes.

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:15.170
I see.

00:20:17.550 --> 00:20:20.220
I wanted to see you graduate, but...

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:24.180
I'll write you letters along the way.

00:20:24.180 --> 00:20:25.800
Though I'll be using an alias.

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:28.510
All right. What name will you use?

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:32.290
Haruto.

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:33.800
Haruto...

00:20:35.450 --> 00:20:36.380
Haruto.

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:39.380
Well then, I should be going.

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:41.460
I'll see you again, won't I?

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:44.550
Yes. I'm sure we'll meet again.

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:49.560
For certain, absolutely certain, understand?

00:20:50.190 --> 00:20:51.010
Stay safe...

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:53.810
until you return... all right?

00:21:02.710 --> 00:21:03.990
Have a safe trip!

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:06.150
I will! I'm off!

00:21:10.840 --> 00:21:12.810
Your letters... I'll be waiting for them.

00:21:13.450 --> 00:21:15.460
I'll be waiting, okay?

00:21:36.470 --> 00:21:38.520
What is your name?

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:40.820
I'm called Celia.

00:21:41.870 --> 00:21:42.820
Rio...

00:21:43.180 --> 00:21:45.780
Rio? That's an unusual name.

00:21:46.170 --> 00:21:47.820
My parents were immigrants.

00:21:48.220 --> 00:21:49.650
Are you all right?

00:21:49.650 --> 00:21:51.700
Don't touch me...

00:21:53.770 --> 00:21:57.080
Just a moment. I'll make us some space.

00:21:57.420 --> 00:22:00.320
There are a lot of 
difficult-looking books here.

00:22:00.320 --> 00:22:02.550
But you look so young, Professor.

00:22:02.550 --> 00:22:04.720
Hm? Oh, yes.

00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:06.760
I'm still only twelve, after all.

00:22:08.130 --> 00:22:09.140
It's very good.

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:12.280
I'm glad you like it! 
When you drink a good cup of tea...

00:22:14.560 --> 00:22:17.270
It just makes you feel happy, doesn't it?

00:22:17.960 --> 00:22:20.120
I have you, Professor Celia.

00:22:20.670 --> 00:22:21.480
Huh?

00:22:21.830 --> 00:22:22.650
What?

00:22:23.370 --> 00:22:25.020
Oh, Rio!

00:22:25.020 --> 00:22:25.440
Yes?

00:22:25.440 --> 00:22:29.230
You're making fun of me, aren't you?
 Treating me like a child!

00:22:29.230 --> 00:22:31.800
But you're older than me, Professor.

00:22:31.800 --> 00:22:39.620
Y-Yes, but... well... it means you 
think of me as a friend, right?

00:22:39.620 --> 00:22:40.430
Yes.

00:22:40.860 --> 00:22:42.410
Would you rather I didn't?

00:22:42.860 --> 00:22:44.420
I... don't mind.

00:22:44.420 --> 00:22:44.920
What?

00:22:45.660 --> 00:22:47.920
I... don't mind.

00:23:11.270 --> 00:23:13.680
That is the clothing of 
the assassination target.

00:23:13.680 --> 00:23:14.950
Remember the scent.

00:23:15.750 --> 00:23:20.270
The target is twelve years old
and male. Goes by Rio.

00:23:20.270 --> 00:23:22.960
His hair is black, so you 
should recognize him quickly.

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:25.770
No matter what it takes, 
find him and kill him,

00:23:26.240 --> 00:23:27.710
Latifa.

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:32.740
Understood.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.040
Next Time

